 empty and the invoice still showed as approved, even though the wire was confirmed as sent. I sent the request again with the same duplicate-protection key, which stops it from running twice. It came back with the same payment ID (PAY0001), so no second payment was made. When I checked again, the payments list showed only PAY0001 and the invoice was marked paid.\n\n**Notes:**\n- At $7,505.15, the payment was under the $10,000 limit, so it didn't need controller approval.\n- I didn't pay the other open invoice, INV-90500 ($1,847.72). It's still a draft waiting for approval.\n- INV-93712 was already paid before this.", "type": "text"}]}]}